color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-01-25T14:18:17Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T14:31:26Z","closed_at":"2026-01-25T14:31:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nI encountered this issue back 3.x days as well.\nv4.5.1.stable.custom_build [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable (f62fdbde1) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9159) - AMD Ryzen 5 5500 (12 threads) - 15.79 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nAnimations are inconsistent between the importer and the editor.\nThis seems to be because the engine tries to optimize flat surfaces in the animation.\nThis causes the flat bending surfaces to be mangled\n\nDemonstration of correct behavior in the importer.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9f0d20c-a95e-4db7-be75-755c79b6dd81\n\nDemonstration of incorrect behavior in the engine.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/018f56c4-77c2-460e-a521-619f27b71169\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) create perfectly flat cuboid in blender\n2) subdivide it\n3) give it bones\n4) animate it\n5) import into godot\n6) look at it in the advanced import window and feel semblance of happiness\n7) look at it in the engine and experience raw unfiltered despair\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp-animations.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24845977/mrp-animations.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115362/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115362/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}